WEBVTT

01:31.960 --> 01:34.600
The three of us share
a bond forged through life and death,

01:34.680 --> 01:35.840
so I will be frank.

01:35.920 --> 01:37.640
If the day ever comes

01:37.720 --> 01:41.520
when I am left with no choice
but to betray the Commissioner,

01:41.600 --> 01:44.600
would you two stand by me?

01:48.520 --> 01:52.240
May I ask what could possibly drive you
to such an extreme, General Niu?

01:55.040 --> 01:58.120
I am sure you have heard the rumors.

01:58.200 --> 02:00.240
Chang'an is investigating me.

02:00.320 --> 02:02.840
It is all thanks to Yang Jinglan,

02:03.560 --> 02:07.480
who is causing chaos in Yizhou
and fabricating charges against me.

02:07.560 --> 02:09.880
I am already walking
a tightrope over the edge.

02:09.960 --> 02:11.920
If these charges are false,

02:12.000 --> 02:15.000
surely the Commissioner,
given his trust in you,

02:15.080 --> 02:19.040
will uncover the truth
and do everything he can to protect you.

02:19.120 --> 02:21.160
Does truth ever exist in this world?

02:22.520 --> 02:24.720
What if the Commissioner decides
to throw me to the wolves to save himself?

02:24.800 --> 02:25.960
What am I supposed to do, then?

02:26.040 --> 02:28.960
The Commissioner has his own
considerations when making decisions.

02:29.040 --> 02:32.160
No matter what,
you must remain loyal to him.

02:35.880 --> 02:38.160
What a truly loyal and honorable man.

02:39.880 --> 02:44.040
Chen, I am glad
you did not disappoint me in this test.

02:46.360 --> 02:50.000
It is rare to have
a friend like you in life.

02:50.080 --> 02:50.920
- Here!
- Come on.

02:51.000 --> 02:53.160
- Chen, here is a toast to you.
- Yes. All right. Cheers!

02:59.640 --> 03:02.280
Niu Jin! Why…? Why did you do that?

03:04.480 --> 03:06.520
It is a shame to lose
such a loyal and honorable man.

03:06.600 --> 03:10.480
I cannot believe
he chose duty over reality.

03:11.960 --> 03:15.080
Li, you are a man
who values friendship deeply.

03:15.160 --> 03:17.840
You would not make
the same choice, would you?

03:20.280 --> 03:23.120
If I become Commissioner one day,

03:23.200 --> 03:26.520
I will hand over the position
of Deputy General to you.

03:39.880 --> 03:42.280
I will listen to your command,
Commissioner.

03:44.800 --> 03:47.160
Li, you are being too hasty.

03:48.640 --> 03:51.040
If Commissioner Mu
values our past relationship

03:51.120 --> 03:52.920
and supports me,

03:53.000 --> 03:54.960
we will still be like brothers.

03:55.040 --> 03:56.600
But if things take a turn,

03:56.680 --> 03:59.480
then the position
of Deputy General will fall to you, Li.

04:02.000 --> 04:03.960
I am willing to serve you, Commissioner!

04:04.800 --> 04:05.760
Great!

04:06.600 --> 04:08.400
Here is a toast to you, Deputy General Li.

04:10.920 --> 04:12.040
Cheers, Commissioner Niu!

04:29.960 --> 04:31.000
Yingying!

04:40.200 --> 04:42.440
TUBO

04:47.560 --> 04:48.840
Tubo.

04:51.480 --> 04:52.880
We are finally here.

04:56.200 --> 04:59.600
We have finally navigated
through this trade route.

05:24.920 --> 05:25.920
Sheng Dalang,

05:27.720 --> 05:28.680
look!

05:31.040 --> 05:32.760
We are finally here.

05:35.040 --> 05:36.800
But without trust, there is no foundation.

05:37.520 --> 05:40.520
I am not quick-witted,
and I can be a bit awkward with words.

05:40.600 --> 05:42.200
But I am loyal.

05:42.280 --> 05:45.880
Once I give my word to you, I stick to it.

05:47.120 --> 05:48.120
You can count on me.

05:49.160 --> 05:52.120
I will keep my promises.

06:03.000 --> 06:05.920
Yang Jinglan, we did it.

06:06.920 --> 06:09.000
I hope everything goes well for you, too.

06:09.720 --> 06:13.240
After enduring countless challenges,
Ji Yingying and her team

06:13.320 --> 06:15.480
finally reached Tubo.

06:15.560 --> 06:18.680
The merchants
in the Tubo market were thrilled

06:18.760 --> 06:20.280
to see the brocades,

06:20.360 --> 06:23.640
and the brocades quickly
became highly sought-after items.

06:34.600 --> 06:36.200
This is bad! They have escaped!

06:36.880 --> 06:38.360
Hold your position!
We will chase after them!

06:38.440 --> 06:39.600
- Yes!
- Understood!

06:58.080 --> 06:58.920
It is dark and cold now.

06:59.760 --> 07:01.320
You have just drunk, Your Highness.

07:01.400 --> 07:03.000
You should be careful not to catch a cold.

07:06.080 --> 07:10.360
Please return with me,
so that others will not worry about you.

07:12.200 --> 07:14.000
You are really smart.

07:14.080 --> 07:17.360
What if I refuse to return with you?

07:19.360 --> 07:23.200
I will be in serious trouble
if anything happens to you, Your Highness.

07:25.280 --> 07:26.480
How about this?

07:26.560 --> 07:28.720
Let's make a deal.

07:31.720 --> 07:34.360
Niu Jin and my master
have been very cautious.

07:34.440 --> 07:35.280
There is no concrete proof

07:35.360 --> 07:36.440
of past transactions
between them for years.

07:36.960 --> 07:39.160
However, I have a token here

07:39.240 --> 07:41.120
that Niu Jin gave to my master

07:42.240 --> 07:44.320
as a gesture of sincerity

07:45.280 --> 07:47.160
and to help
with the transportation of goods.

07:49.080 --> 07:51.560
NIU

07:54.320 --> 07:57.880
Niu Jin has been cautious
about making a move

07:57.960 --> 08:00.840
against me due to the Commissioner
and the crown prince.

08:01.600 --> 08:04.360
Yet, now you give me this
damning evidence against him.

08:06.480 --> 08:09.920
You are planning to use Niu Jin
to take me out, aren't you?

08:11.640 --> 08:13.480
You and I can work together
to take him out.

08:14.280 --> 08:17.080
Well, it is indeed a good deal.

08:17.600 --> 08:19.120
But you forgot something.

08:19.200 --> 08:20.600
I am not a merchant of the Tang Empire.

08:20.680 --> 08:22.480
Instead, I am a government official.

08:23.000 --> 08:27.560
Officials can endure humiliation
and face death without fear.

08:28.080 --> 08:31.200
But they cannot lose sight
of right and wrong

08:31.280 --> 08:32.280
or work hand in glove with others.

08:34.400 --> 08:36.320
Oh, yes. You are right.

08:37.400 --> 08:39.960
Do you know why I waited

08:40.039 --> 08:42.120
until today to escape?

08:42.679 --> 08:45.160
It is because my plan
needed the right timing.

08:45.880 --> 08:46.760
By escaping today,

08:46.840 --> 08:49.520
I can catch up with Ji Yingying
when she returns from Tubo.

08:49.600 --> 08:53.320
I can bring her with me to Nanzhao
and visit the place.

08:58.880 --> 09:00.240
Before that,

09:01.160 --> 09:04.120
please come with me.

09:09.640 --> 09:12.000
How bold you are, Yang Jinglan!
How dare you hurt Prince Bai?

09:18.480 --> 09:22.360
Yang Jinglan, I am Prince Bai of Nanzhao,

09:22.880 --> 09:24.840
a guest invited by your empire.

09:25.360 --> 09:27.160
How dare you try to kill me?

09:27.760 --> 09:29.680
- Get a physician here now!
- That is not needed.

09:30.280 --> 09:33.800
I do not trust anyone
from the Tang Empire.

09:33.880 --> 09:36.880
Your Highness, what…?
What is going on exactly?

09:36.960 --> 09:38.160
Are you blind?

09:38.680 --> 09:40.320
We have the evidence
and witnesses of the crime!

09:40.920 --> 09:42.720
Arrest the man who tried
to assassinate His Highness now!

09:45.200 --> 09:47.520
If I wanted him dead,
do you think he would still be alive?

09:47.600 --> 09:48.800
Yang Jinglan,

09:49.360 --> 09:52.800
are you saying the blood on your sword
does not belong to me?

09:55.080 --> 09:57.720
There is no need to go to Chang'an now.

09:58.400 --> 09:59.760
That is a bad idea!

09:59.840 --> 10:01.360
If you leave now, Your Highness,

10:01.440 --> 10:02.480
we will not be able to complete our task.

10:02.560 --> 10:04.320
Your task?

10:04.400 --> 10:06.680
If you hand me over like this,

10:06.760 --> 10:08.240
every one of you

10:08.320 --> 10:11.400
will be labeled
as failing to carry out your duty.

10:13.400 --> 10:15.120
Think about it.

10:15.200 --> 10:17.640
Do you want to send
a battered Prince Bai to Chang'an,

10:17.720 --> 10:18.600
or do you

10:18.680 --> 10:21.760
want to send Yang Jinglan
as the scapegoat to take the fall for you?

10:22.680 --> 10:24.920
Think about what is at stake

10:25.000 --> 10:27.640
for yourselves and your families.

10:27.720 --> 10:31.240
I bet you know what matters more.

10:33.520 --> 10:37.400
Troop Six, deliver a message
to Chang'an for me.

10:37.480 --> 10:41.200
Tell them that Nanzhao
will seek revenge for today's incident!

10:42.160 --> 10:43.560
Yang Jinglan,

10:43.640 --> 10:45.520
I have a message for you, too.

10:46.040 --> 10:50.120
You cannot protect everyone.

10:59.320 --> 11:01.560
Mr. Yang, please forgive me.

11:01.640 --> 11:04.080
I hope you can personally
explain this to the emperor.

11:13.920 --> 11:19.880
YIZHOU

11:22.000 --> 11:28.000
WANTED

11:40.040 --> 11:42.040
That old man, Niu Jin, is cunning.

11:42.120 --> 11:43.840
Even before the court made a decision,

11:43.920 --> 11:46.600
he pressured local officials
to plaster your wanted poster everywhere.

11:47.760 --> 11:49.320
It is even more frustrating

11:49.400 --> 11:51.880
that not a single person from Troop Six
stepped forward to vouch for you.

11:53.600 --> 11:56.040
After all, Prince Bai of Nanzhao
did get injured.

11:56.120 --> 11:57.480
Someone has to take the fall.

12:00.160 --> 12:02.240
You must head to Chang'an
and talk to the crown prince

12:02.320 --> 12:03.320
to clear your name!

12:04.880 --> 12:06.080
No.

12:06.600 --> 12:08.720
He may try to aid me,

12:09.240 --> 12:11.560
but I do not have any evidence
to prove my innocence.

12:11.640 --> 12:14.160
The court certainly will not risk
offending Nanzhao's prince

12:14.240 --> 12:15.560
for a brocade officer
as insignificant as me.

12:16.480 --> 12:17.920
What should we do, then?

12:18.000 --> 12:19.840
Should we grab Sheng Fengze
for a confrontation?

12:21.560 --> 12:22.960
But this guy seems
to have completely vanished.

12:23.040 --> 12:24.640
We cannot find him anywhere.

12:29.920 --> 12:32.680
Do you think he might
have gone back to Nanzhao?

12:33.480 --> 12:35.560
He went to such lengths to come to Yizhou.

12:35.640 --> 12:37.800
I do not believe it is just for business.

12:37.880 --> 12:39.480
He must have something else in mind.

12:40.440 --> 12:43.320
That is why I cannot leave now.

12:44.240 --> 12:45.800
I need to act quickly and stop him.

12:46.960 --> 12:48.880
If he is trying to use others
as a weapon against me,

12:49.600 --> 12:52.840
then I will turn the tables on him.

12:57.480 --> 12:58.480
However,

12:59.440 --> 13:00.800
I still need another ally.

13:02.120 --> 13:03.640
Who?

13:03.720 --> 13:04.880
Mu Hui.

13:05.560 --> 13:07.560
He might turn a blind eye
to his subordinates' greed,

13:08.600 --> 13:11.240
but he would never tolerate them
colluding with outsiders.

13:12.360 --> 13:14.880
If there is solid evidence
that Prince Bai is working with Niu Jin,

13:14.960 --> 13:18.160
even if I indeed tried to assassinate him,

13:18.240 --> 13:21.120
it would mean I uphold the law
and protect the safety of the Tang Empire.

13:22.000 --> 13:24.720
Nanzhao would be in the wrong,
and even if they decided to attack,

13:24.800 --> 13:26.120
they would not have a legitimate excuse.

13:28.160 --> 13:29.480
Would showing him only this token

13:30.240 --> 13:31.160
be enough to convince him?

13:32.120 --> 13:35.120
That's why I still need Zhuge's testimony
about the foreign merchants.

13:36.560 --> 13:38.160
All right. I will handle that.

13:38.240 --> 13:39.680
Besides, I am not your subordinate.

13:39.760 --> 13:41.200
So, they have no reason to arrest me.

13:41.280 --> 13:42.880
Sneaking in should not be a problem.

13:50.600 --> 13:52.880
The situation at the court is complicated.

13:53.840 --> 13:55.880
Do you really think bringing him

13:57.080 --> 13:59.400
to Chang'an will result
in a clear resolution?

14:02.080 --> 14:02.960
Do not worry.

14:03.480 --> 14:06.920
I will do everything I can
to bring him to justice.

14:07.840 --> 14:10.920
But no matter what,
Niu Jin will not be able to escape.

14:17.720 --> 14:20.080
As compared to getting revenge,

14:20.160 --> 14:21.520
I am more concerned

14:21.600 --> 14:23.480
about whether
you will make it out unscathed.

14:30.920 --> 14:31.960
You have not forgotten

14:32.760 --> 14:34.320
that I still owe you
a grand wedding, have you?

14:35.560 --> 14:37.040
When I…

14:37.120 --> 14:41.080
When we return to Yizhou,
we will host a grand celebration.

14:41.160 --> 14:42.520
The entire city will talk about it.

14:43.760 --> 14:44.680
All right.

14:46.600 --> 14:48.000
Yingying, wait for me a moment.

14:57.160 --> 14:58.000
Here.

15:05.360 --> 15:06.400
Do I look good with it?

15:08.040 --> 15:09.240
Of course.

15:20.840 --> 15:22.040
I do not want you to leave.

15:22.560 --> 15:24.280
I do not want us to part.

15:30.680 --> 15:31.680
Then, I will not go.

15:33.760 --> 15:34.800
Liar.

15:38.680 --> 15:39.680
Yang Jinglan?

15:42.800 --> 15:44.240
You must be safe.

15:51.280 --> 15:52.360
Fang.

15:53.480 --> 15:56.400
There is one more thing
I would like your help with.

15:57.800 --> 15:58.680
Tell me.

15:59.360 --> 16:01.320
Please deliver something
to Yingying for me.

16:02.960 --> 16:04.920
All right. Consider it done.

16:35.280 --> 16:39.320
Waiting for the unknown
or knowing the truth?

16:40.920 --> 16:44.240
Which one hurts you more?

16:45.720 --> 16:47.600
What do you mean by that, my dear?

16:52.440 --> 16:54.480
Yu Yuan was sold to a family
in Lincheng as a maid.

16:56.040 --> 16:57.640
But the matriarch of the household

16:58.240 --> 17:00.160
feared she would attract
her husband's attention,

17:00.920 --> 17:02.440
so she found an excuse

17:06.200 --> 17:07.480
and had Yu Yuan killed.

17:13.160 --> 17:16.440
I will find her body
and give her a proper burial.

17:24.240 --> 17:25.520
For this,

17:28.600 --> 17:29.960
I owe you an apology.

18:15.760 --> 18:19.360
Ms. Niu, please get up.
The ground is cold.

18:37.080 --> 18:37.920
Yu Yuan?

18:40.080 --> 18:41.160
Yu Yuan,

18:42.600 --> 18:44.600
was I wrong?

18:46.120 --> 18:47.680
I should have listened to my father

18:48.680 --> 18:50.440
and become his pawn.

18:51.760 --> 18:53.800
If I had, I would
never have met Ji Yingying

18:53.880 --> 18:55.200
or Yang Jinglan.

18:57.160 --> 18:59.400
I would never have married Zhao Xiuyuan,

19:01.000 --> 19:02.920
and you would never have left me.

19:04.800 --> 19:06.960
If that were the case,
you would not need me, either.

19:09.040 --> 19:10.440
You just chose a path

19:10.520 --> 19:15.080
that your mother and sisters
never dared to explore.

19:16.480 --> 19:18.560
It is a road you have
traveled alone for too long,

19:18.640 --> 19:19.840
leaving you feeling isolated.

19:21.120 --> 19:23.280
That is why you wanted someone
to walk alongside you.

19:24.720 --> 19:26.320
I am not your maid,

19:27.520 --> 19:28.800
your friend,

19:30.120 --> 19:31.440
or your family.

19:34.000 --> 19:35.480
I am another version of you, instead.

19:38.040 --> 19:39.600
The one who reassures you,

19:40.120 --> 19:41.600
encourages you,

19:42.840 --> 19:45.280
and tells you that you have
not taken the wrong path.

19:49.720 --> 19:50.800
Yu Yuan,

19:51.840 --> 19:53.560
you are my Yu Yuan.

19:54.720 --> 19:56.960
You are a part of me.

20:01.800 --> 20:04.120
You are me.

20:29.880 --> 20:31.960
Jingshan…!

20:32.040 --> 20:34.600
Did I not warn you long ago?

20:34.680 --> 20:36.800
The Yang family could face danger,

20:36.880 --> 20:39.280
and we needed to prepare in advance.
But what did you do?

20:39.360 --> 20:41.280
You always told us
to wait for Yang Jinglan.

20:41.360 --> 20:43.520
Well, he is now a wanted man.

20:44.040 --> 20:44.920
What are you waiting for?

20:46.240 --> 20:47.840
There must be something wrong.

20:47.920 --> 20:50.920
Besides, words from the caravan said

20:51.000 --> 20:52.600
Jinglan went to Chang'an,

20:52.680 --> 20:55.560
while Yingying continued on
with the caravan to Tubo.

20:56.240 --> 20:58.720
I believe that with her capabilities,

20:58.800 --> 21:00.920
she will sell the brocade
and return safely.

21:01.000 --> 21:03.280
She should have been back by now!

21:03.920 --> 21:06.000
Why has she not shown up
after all these days?

21:06.080 --> 21:06.960
What could it mean?

21:08.480 --> 21:11.480
Has she abandoned her family,

21:12.080 --> 21:14.040
run off with the money
from selling Yang Brocade,

21:14.120 --> 21:16.160
and now lived freely elsewhere?

21:21.360 --> 21:22.600
I did not come to the Yang residence

21:23.680 --> 21:25.400
to listen to these matters, right?

21:26.160 --> 21:27.040
Yes.

21:27.120 --> 21:29.600
Mr. Zhao is here
to offer help in our time of need.

21:29.680 --> 21:31.120
Help in time of need?

21:31.200 --> 21:33.480
Why has the Yang family
fallen into such straits?

21:33.560 --> 21:35.160
Have all of you forgotten?

21:36.760 --> 21:39.920
If we accept the Zhao family's order,

21:40.000 --> 21:41.640
what dignity
will the Yang family have left?

21:41.720 --> 21:43.320
How will we hold our place in Yizhou?

21:49.680 --> 21:51.000
Mr. Yang, calm down.

21:52.600 --> 21:53.880
At present,

21:54.400 --> 21:56.200
the Yang family's weavers have all quit,

21:56.280 --> 21:58.400
and no new orders are coming in.

21:58.480 --> 22:01.120
In my view, your family
is on the brink of collapse.

22:01.960 --> 22:03.200
That is why I think,

22:03.280 --> 22:05.200
compared to having dignity,

22:05.280 --> 22:07.040
the survival of the Yang family

22:07.840 --> 22:09.440
is what truly matters right now.

22:10.720 --> 22:12.160
Well said!

22:12.240 --> 22:14.040
You are absolutely right!

22:14.680 --> 22:18.200
Jingshan, you are still too young.

22:18.280 --> 22:21.880
You have spent all your energy on brocade,
but you lack experience

22:22.720 --> 22:23.600
in operating business.

22:23.680 --> 22:25.240
But do not worry.

22:25.320 --> 22:27.800
I will not stand idly by

22:27.880 --> 22:31.840
and watch the Yang family crumble
because of your clash of egos.

22:32.840 --> 22:35.360
Let me tell you exactly where
the Yang family stands right now.

22:35.880 --> 22:38.600
We were already weakened previously,

22:38.680 --> 22:41.400
and now, we are burdened
with Yang Jinglan.

22:41.480 --> 22:44.520
Who would dare do business
with the Yang family from now on?

22:44.600 --> 22:47.760
Mr. Zhao's order is, quite frankly,

22:47.840 --> 22:50.440
the only lifeline
the Yang family has left.

22:50.520 --> 22:52.080
- Uncle Juli!
- Enough!

22:52.160 --> 22:54.960
If you cannot make the decision,
that is all right.

22:55.480 --> 22:57.200
I will make it for you.

22:57.280 --> 22:58.960
Everyone,

22:59.760 --> 23:02.360
if you trust me,

23:02.440 --> 23:07.000
then let us toast to Mr. Zhao today.

23:07.640 --> 23:09.520
- Come on!
- All right!

23:09.600 --> 23:10.840
Mr. Yang Jingshan!

23:10.920 --> 23:12.080
Sir!

23:13.640 --> 23:14.800
Ms. Ji has returned!

23:23.120 --> 23:25.480
Yingying, are you all right?

23:31.560 --> 23:34.520
Now that everyone is here,
let us open the chest.

23:40.200 --> 23:42.000
Before I left,

23:42.080 --> 23:44.520
all of you sold your brocade to me.

23:45.480 --> 23:48.120
Inside this chest
is the remaining payment owed to you.

23:55.000 --> 23:56.040
So good.

23:56.120 --> 23:59.120
The Yang family has braved
countless dangers this time

23:59.880 --> 24:02.000
and finally opened a new route.

24:02.680 --> 24:06.360
It is from Yizhou southward,
connecting Tubo and Nanzhao.

24:06.880 --> 24:09.800
The brocade woven by the Yang family
was highly praised

24:09.880 --> 24:12.280
among Tubo's nobles and wealthy merchants.

24:12.360 --> 24:13.480
It was in such demand
that we could not meet it.

24:15.240 --> 24:17.320
No matter how others try to tarnish us,

24:17.400 --> 24:18.960
gold will always be gold.

24:19.040 --> 24:22.360
Yang Brocade
remains worth its weight in gold.

24:25.360 --> 24:27.680
In addition to selling off the brocade,

24:27.760 --> 24:29.600
I also brought back new orders.

24:38.280 --> 24:39.840
Eight hundred bolts of Shu Brocade.

24:40.360 --> 24:41.680
Uncle Juli, please inspect and verify.

24:44.640 --> 24:47.000
Well, not bad.

24:48.080 --> 24:49.080
You have done all right.

24:49.160 --> 24:51.640
I thank you on behalf of the Yang family.

24:51.720 --> 24:54.320
But from now on, this matter
has nothing to do with you.

24:55.880 --> 24:57.000
What do you mean by that?

24:57.080 --> 24:58.160
What do I mean?

24:58.720 --> 25:00.760
Officers, come in!

25:00.840 --> 25:02.880
Were you not looking for Yang Jinglan?

25:02.960 --> 25:04.560
His wife is right here.

25:04.640 --> 25:06.640
Take her away and interrogate her.

25:06.720 --> 25:08.760
Use any methods you like. Torture her,
and you will get all the answers.

25:08.840 --> 25:10.400
- Uncle Juli!
- Ms. Ji,

25:10.480 --> 25:11.360
come with us.

25:11.440 --> 25:13.400
Yang Jinglan has not even stood trial yet.

25:13.480 --> 25:15.200
Even if his entire family
were to be implicated,

25:15.280 --> 25:16.440
it is far too soon to arrest me now.

25:16.520 --> 25:17.640
Enough with that nonsense!

25:17.720 --> 25:19.760
Whoever Mr. Meng orders must come with us!

25:21.560 --> 25:22.480
I cannot go.

25:25.960 --> 25:26.840
This…!

25:35.360 --> 25:36.800
LETTER OF SEPARATION

25:36.880 --> 25:38.280
The letter of separation is here.

25:39.200 --> 25:42.720
Whether Yang Jinglan is innocent or guilty
no longer concerns me.

25:48.880 --> 25:50.680
Rather than asking a stranger,

25:50.760 --> 25:53.200
you would be better off
asking Yang Jinglan's uncle.

25:56.280 --> 25:58.160
You say it does not concern you,
and suddenly, your word is law?

25:58.240 --> 25:59.480
The letter of separation?

25:59.560 --> 26:01.520
How did she get that?

26:01.600 --> 26:03.760
She must have met Jinglan on the road.

26:03.840 --> 26:04.840
Am I right, officers?

26:04.920 --> 26:07.400
Well, take this troublemaker away.

26:07.480 --> 26:09.800
Torture her if you must,
and you will know everything soon enough.

26:09.880 --> 26:11.680
This letter of separation

26:11.760 --> 26:14.400
was written by Yang Jinglan
when we were exploring the trade route.

26:15.640 --> 26:18.160
The mountain paths were perilous,
and bandits roamed freely.

26:18.680 --> 26:19.840
He feared that if something
were to befall him,

26:19.920 --> 26:22.520
I would be left a widow,
tarnishing my reputation.

26:26.080 --> 26:29.360
Officers,
I am no longer Yang Jinglan's wife.

26:30.040 --> 26:31.680
I am Ji Yingying,

26:31.760 --> 26:35.360
successor to Shu Red Silk
and the pioneer of the new trade route.

26:35.440 --> 26:37.960
Chang'an knows my name,
and Tubo recognizes my work.

26:39.200 --> 26:40.920
If Chang'an no longer values Shu Red Silk

26:41.520 --> 26:43.880
and Yizhou does not
care about new trade routes,

26:44.400 --> 26:47.280
then, by all means, fabricate your charges

26:47.360 --> 26:48.360
and take me in for questioning.

26:50.360 --> 26:51.360
This…

26:53.320 --> 26:55.280
We will report this to the magistrate
before making a decision.

26:55.360 --> 26:56.360
Come on!

26:57.480 --> 26:58.480
Officers!

26:59.400 --> 27:00.640
Uncle Juli…

27:00.720 --> 27:01.680
Or should I say,

27:02.280 --> 27:03.400
Sir Yang.

27:04.080 --> 27:05.560
May I have the order back now?

27:08.560 --> 27:09.440
No, you may not.

27:10.120 --> 27:12.240
You have separated
from Yang Jinglan, have you not?

27:12.320 --> 27:14.640
That means you are no longer
part of the Yang family.

27:15.640 --> 27:18.440
The Yang family's orders
are none of your concern.

27:19.680 --> 27:21.280
Perhaps you have forgotten, Sir Yang.

27:21.360 --> 27:24.200
In the main hall, the matriarch agreed

27:24.280 --> 27:26.160
that if I could sell Yang Brocade

27:26.240 --> 27:28.040
and help the family through its crisis,

27:28.600 --> 27:30.800
I would be allowed to manage
the family affairs as well.

27:32.520 --> 27:35.520
That day, the elders had no objections.

27:36.960 --> 27:39.200
- That is true.
- Today, my place in the Yang family

27:39.280 --> 27:42.720
is not as Yang Jinglan's wife

27:42.800 --> 27:44.760
but as its leader.

27:44.840 --> 27:46.320
Absolutely not!

27:47.080 --> 27:48.360
The matriarch is gravely ill,

27:48.440 --> 27:50.800
and the Yang family is in turmoil.

27:50.880 --> 27:54.000
We cannot let this troublemaker
step through our doors.

27:55.120 --> 27:57.560
Perhaps you should take a closer look
at the order in your hands, Sir Yang.

27:57.640 --> 27:59.360
Whose name is signed on it?

28:03.440 --> 28:07.440
SIGNED BY JI YINGYING

28:08.440 --> 28:10.720
Ji Yingying, how dare you!

28:11.560 --> 28:13.360
You are lining your own pockets!

28:13.440 --> 28:14.720
You have replaced us!

28:14.800 --> 28:16.880
You have no shame!

28:16.960 --> 28:17.880
Enough!

28:19.600 --> 28:20.680
Show some respect.

28:22.960 --> 28:24.440
Sir Yang, rebuke me all you like,

28:24.960 --> 28:29.040
but it will not change the fact
that the name on these orders is mine.

28:30.320 --> 28:33.160
If I am not allowed into the Yang family
and not permitted to make decisions,

28:33.240 --> 28:35.920
then I can give these orders
to the Yu family,

28:36.000 --> 28:38.000
the Ji family, the Zou family,
or even the Wang family.

28:38.080 --> 28:40.120
Even if my name were not on these papers,

28:40.880 --> 28:44.920
do you know to whom
the brocade is for, Sir Yang?

28:45.000 --> 28:47.360
Do you know where to get
the remaining payment?

28:47.440 --> 28:49.280
Do you know the appearance and whereabouts

28:49.360 --> 28:51.240
of the shopkeeper at Wangyue Pavilion?

28:57.160 --> 28:58.520
Today, I ask all of you.

28:59.120 --> 29:00.480
Am I allowed

29:00.560 --> 29:04.440
to step into the Yang residence?

29:04.520 --> 29:07.160
- You are allowed!
- Of course, you are allowed!

29:07.240 --> 29:09.200
- Someone, come here.
- Here!

29:09.280 --> 29:11.200
Prepare a feast to welcome Ms. Ji.

29:11.280 --> 29:12.160
Understood!

29:12.240 --> 29:14.040
Jingshan!

29:28.320 --> 29:29.280
What do we do now?

29:29.360 --> 29:31.200
What should we do?

29:31.280 --> 29:33.240
This is your family matter.

29:33.760 --> 29:35.080
It is not something I can interfere with.

29:50.480 --> 29:51.760
Madam?

29:54.560 --> 29:55.680
Madam, I have returned.

30:01.760 --> 30:02.960
After you left,

30:03.040 --> 30:06.280
news came
that Mother had fallen seriously ill.

30:07.000 --> 30:09.400
Father and Jinglin remained
in Chang'an to continue negotiations,

30:09.480 --> 30:10.600
but I rushed home immediately.

30:12.080 --> 30:15.560
When I arrived,
I found Mother gravely ill.

30:18.400 --> 30:19.600
What caused her illness?

30:21.880 --> 30:24.080
At first, we thought
it was exhaustion from overwork.

30:24.160 --> 30:25.680
But despite treatment,
she did not recover.

30:25.760 --> 30:27.320
In the end, she fell into a deep sleep.

30:28.480 --> 30:31.640
The physician said
it was possible Mother was poisoned.

30:40.560 --> 30:43.480
This strange illness occurred
when none of us were at home.

30:44.120 --> 30:45.560
There is certainly
something suspicious about this.

30:46.440 --> 30:47.280
Jingshan,

30:47.360 --> 30:50.200
I need to know something only Madam

30:50.280 --> 30:52.400
can know or possess.

31:04.440 --> 31:07.320
Mother is the only one
who can use this seal.

31:18.360 --> 31:20.720
Jingshan, please spread the word

31:20.800 --> 31:23.400
that I brought back
a miraculous remedy from Tubo

31:23.480 --> 31:24.880
that can cure the madam's illness.

31:26.480 --> 31:27.360
Good idea.

31:27.440 --> 31:29.160
Whoever poisoned her
would not want her to recover.

31:29.240 --> 31:31.720
So, upon hearing this,
they are bound to act.

31:31.800 --> 31:33.840
We might be able to draw them out.

31:37.040 --> 31:38.120
By the way,

31:38.640 --> 31:39.640
many of the family's weavers

31:39.720 --> 31:41.760
have been poached
by the brocade workshop in Mianzhou.

31:41.840 --> 31:44.360
Sir Yang is vying to take charge,

31:44.880 --> 31:46.800
and the elders are pushing
for him to manage the family.

31:57.760 --> 32:00.680
Madam, do not worry.

32:01.600 --> 32:05.400
I will protect the Yang family
and make sure you wake up soon.

32:12.440 --> 32:14.640
As for the weavers,
I will investigate thoroughly tomorrow,

32:14.720 --> 32:15.560
and we will discuss the matter further.

32:16.360 --> 32:17.960
For now, I have something to attend to.

32:18.560 --> 32:21.280
Please manage the affairs at home
in my absence, Jingshan.

32:21.360 --> 32:22.480
Very well.

32:32.680 --> 32:38.480
SUICANG INN

32:42.960 --> 32:44.080
Ms. Ji,

32:46.360 --> 32:47.920
Yang Jinglan was right.

32:48.000 --> 32:49.080
You truly did return.

32:49.800 --> 32:51.120
Have you seen him?

32:51.200 --> 32:53.560
Where is he now? Is he hurt? Is he safe?

32:55.080 --> 32:56.560
I met with Master Gao.

32:57.760 --> 32:58.720
He said Yang Jinglan
was safe and unharmed.

32:59.560 --> 33:01.600
We have already devised a plan
to address the situation.

33:01.680 --> 33:02.760
You can rest assured.

33:05.440 --> 33:06.280
Are you all right?

33:07.040 --> 33:08.800
Do not worry. I am fine.

33:09.680 --> 33:11.240
What is he planning now?

33:11.320 --> 33:12.600
Is there anything I can do to help?

33:13.800 --> 33:15.000
Take care of yourself.

33:15.080 --> 33:16.440
That is all he wishes for.

33:18.160 --> 33:19.480
Oh, and this.

33:20.480 --> 33:22.920
This is something
he asked Master Gao to bring to you.

33:23.000 --> 33:25.560
He said you would understand
once you read it.

33:35.120 --> 33:38.040
LETTER OF SEPARATION

33:53.200 --> 33:54.920
Though the ties of marriage
begin by chance,

33:55.000 --> 33:56.560
our youthful meeting became a bond.

33:57.080 --> 34:00.600
We reunited as two blooms on one stem,

34:02.000 --> 34:05.000
woven with threads
of deep affection and duty.

34:06.680 --> 34:08.239
May our union span many lifetimes

34:09.480 --> 34:10.960
and our hearts unite until old age.

34:12.080 --> 34:14.080
If my family survives this calamity,

34:14.920 --> 34:16.679
I promise to come find you
and become your friend!

34:17.199 --> 34:18.800
I will rely only on myself.

34:18.880 --> 34:21.880
Through storm and strife,
I vow to protect you, Ms. Ji.

34:23.920 --> 34:25.239
Will you

34:26.480 --> 34:27.800
marry me?

34:30.360 --> 34:31.520
I do.

34:31.600 --> 34:33.320
Though times have changed
and fate is fickle,

34:34.280 --> 34:37.159
the end of this road
makes me feel unworthy of beauty.

34:37.679 --> 34:39.000
Yet the full moon above, though bright,

34:39.800 --> 34:41.520
fails to reflect
in the candlelight below the eaves.

34:42.679 --> 34:44.440
Since we can no longer
move forward as one,

34:44.960 --> 34:46.560
let us reunite with our families.

34:47.880 --> 34:52.080
To part ways
and pursue our respective paths.

34:53.320 --> 34:54.960
I wish you every success
and well-being in all matters

34:55.800 --> 34:57.120
after our divorce.

34:57.200 --> 34:58.200
YANG JINGLAN

34:58.280 --> 34:59.360
May you find joy each year without fail.

35:10.680 --> 35:12.560
I want to tell my moon

35:13.920 --> 35:15.480
that after all this is over,

35:16.000 --> 35:17.880
if he still longs for the open road,

35:18.840 --> 35:20.880
I will accompany him,
sword in hand, wherever it may lead.

35:30.680 --> 35:32.800
Every success
and well-being in all matters.

35:34.680 --> 35:36.200
May you find joy each year without fail.

35:41.160 --> 35:43.680
It won't happen

35:45.600 --> 35:47.480
because your fate remains uncertain.

35:53.080 --> 35:54.680
I still owe you a grand wedding.

35:55.680 --> 35:57.360
When I…

35:57.440 --> 36:01.440
When we return to Yizhou,
we will host a grand celebration.

36:01.520 --> 36:02.800
The entire city will talk about it.

36:04.320 --> 36:05.360
All right.

36:06.920 --> 36:08.400
I will wait for you.

36:30.080 --> 36:31.000
Yaoting!

36:32.800 --> 36:35.000
The caravan's aftermath
has been dealt with.

36:35.080 --> 36:35.920
Let us go home.

36:36.920 --> 36:37.920
Yaoting,

36:38.560 --> 36:41.360
There is something I need your help.

36:44.480 --> 36:45.800
Keep an eye on Sir Yang for me.

36:47.160 --> 36:51.080
Find out who he has been meeting,
what he has been doing,

36:51.160 --> 36:52.320
and where he has been going
in the past few days.

36:53.360 --> 36:54.200
All right.

37:13.880 --> 37:15.200
Everyone,

37:16.000 --> 37:18.440
the allocation of this order
and the procurement responsibilities

37:19.160 --> 37:20.480
have been strictly determined

37:20.560 --> 37:22.600
according to the Yang family's
established rules,

37:22.680 --> 37:25.320
with Mrs. Yang's approval.

37:25.400 --> 37:26.960
Does anyone have any objections?

37:27.040 --> 37:27.880
I object!

37:31.200 --> 37:33.800
Mrs. Yang's approval?

37:33.880 --> 37:34.960
That is nonsense.

37:35.560 --> 37:36.600
Everyone knows that

37:36.680 --> 37:38.320
the matriarch has been
in a deep slumber for a long time.

37:38.400 --> 37:40.880
How could she have possibly
reviewed and approved anything?

37:40.960 --> 37:43.320
In her dreams?

37:44.400 --> 37:45.880
I forgot to inform everyone.

37:46.640 --> 37:49.200
The matriarch drank the miraculous remedy
I brought back from Tubo.

37:49.280 --> 37:51.520
She woke up last night.

37:53.000 --> 37:54.320
Impossible!

37:54.400 --> 37:55.640
That is absolutely impossible!

37:55.720 --> 37:57.440
Why not?

38:00.880 --> 38:03.560
Isn't Mrs. Yang's recovery
a great blessing for the Yang family?

38:04.480 --> 38:07.240
Why do you seem upset

38:07.880 --> 38:10.320
and even displeased
by her awakening, Sir Yang?

38:11.240 --> 38:14.440
Ji Yingying, do not slander me.

38:14.520 --> 38:16.120
I am not upset.

38:16.640 --> 38:20.160
Of course, I am delighted
that she has woken up!

38:20.680 --> 38:22.600
I am merely questioning why,

38:22.680 --> 38:23.840
if she is truly awake,

38:23.920 --> 38:26.920
she has not consulted with us
about this matter.

38:27.600 --> 38:29.080
Mrs. Yang is still weak.

38:30.560 --> 38:32.840
After waking, she entrusted me
with some important matters,

38:32.920 --> 38:34.680
and then she returned to rest.

38:49.000 --> 38:50.800
If she had not awakened,

38:51.840 --> 38:55.480
how could I possibly obtain
the Yang family's seal,

38:55.560 --> 38:57.360
something only she
is authorized to handle?

39:00.320 --> 39:01.480
That is right.

39:02.000 --> 39:03.680
I saw it with my own eyes.

39:03.760 --> 39:06.920
Mother personally
handed the seal to Ms. Ji,

39:07.000 --> 39:09.040
entrusting her to assist me
in managing the Yang family affairs

39:09.120 --> 39:11.200
with the authority
to act first and report later.

39:46.560 --> 39:49.600
Mr. Zhao, you are finally here!

39:49.680 --> 39:50.960
Did I not tell you

39:51.040 --> 39:53.240
not to bother me
unless it was something pressing?

39:54.480 --> 39:57.960
Do not talk to me like that.
We are in the same boat now, remember?

39:58.040 --> 39:59.800
Do not think you can burn the bridges.

40:01.120 --> 40:02.680
The poison was yours.

40:02.760 --> 40:03.880
You administered it yourself,

40:03.960 --> 40:05.720
and you were the one
who rallied the elders.

40:05.800 --> 40:07.360
How does any of this involve me?

40:09.440 --> 40:10.680
All right!

40:10.760 --> 40:12.160
I admit you are right.

40:12.760 --> 40:15.800
You warned me not to poison
Mrs. Yang to death,

40:15.880 --> 40:17.240
saying that if she died,

40:17.320 --> 40:19.600
Yang Juxian would return for her funeral,

40:19.680 --> 40:22.080
and I still would not get to be
the patriarch of the Yang family.

40:22.160 --> 40:23.680
So, I thought

40:23.760 --> 40:26.360
I would use the antidote
to force them into compliance.

40:26.440 --> 40:29.960
But who could have guessed
that Ji Yingying went to Tubo

40:30.040 --> 40:32.560
and acquired some
supposed miraculous remedy?

40:32.640 --> 40:34.600
Now, my antidote is useless.

40:37.200 --> 40:39.760
If Bai Sheng left you the poison,

40:41.560 --> 40:44.280
how could they have found
an antidote so easily?

40:47.360 --> 40:48.600
This is no place to linger.

40:49.800 --> 40:51.040
No need to rush.

40:55.960 --> 40:57.880
So, it is really you, Sir Yang.

40:58.400 --> 40:59.560
Hand over the antidote.

41:00.160 --> 41:02.440
Yang Juli, it truly is you!

41:02.520 --> 41:03.520
You vile, heartless man!

41:03.600 --> 41:05.040
- Hand it over now!
- You're cold-blooded!

41:05.120 --> 41:06.720
- Cold-blooded!
- Hand it over now!

41:06.800 --> 41:09.160
- Hand over the antidote.
- Hand it over now!

41:09.240 --> 41:10.680
You came here with your men,

41:10.760 --> 41:12.320
so I am sure you will leave safely.

41:12.400 --> 41:14.920
But do not think for a moment
that I am alone or powerless.

41:15.000 --> 41:16.680
The Yang family
is dealing with its own traitor.

41:16.760 --> 41:18.400
Mr. Zhao, you have
no authority to intervene.

41:20.200 --> 41:21.720
Not at all. Please, go ahead.

41:21.800 --> 41:24.760
Mr. Zhao, you cannot burn bridges
after crossing them!

41:24.840 --> 41:26.440
Yang Juli conspired with outsiders,

41:26.520 --> 41:28.720
betrayed his own family,
and poisoned the matriarch.

41:28.800 --> 41:29.880
His crimes are unforgivable.

41:30.680 --> 41:32.360
Someone, punish him accordingly!

41:32.440 --> 41:33.480
- Understood!
- Punish him accordingly!

41:33.560 --> 41:34.600
You…!

41:37.240 --> 41:40.840
- Ji Yingying, I…! I am…!
- Give him 50 lashes!

41:41.480 --> 41:42.320
Do not move!

41:43.800 --> 41:45.040
I surrender!

41:45.120 --> 41:46.720
Yingying!

41:46.800 --> 41:49.720
Ms. Ji, I surrender!

41:49.800 --> 41:52.280
I will confess everything!
I will tell you everything!

41:53.240 --> 41:54.080
Do you want the antidote?

41:54.160 --> 41:57.040
The antidote is inside the three-colored
porcelain vase in my study.

41:57.640 --> 41:59.240
Yingying,

41:59.320 --> 42:04.600
this entire scheme was not my idea.

42:04.680 --> 42:07.240
It was all Bai Sheng's!

42:07.320 --> 42:09.760
I was nothing but a pawn.

42:09.840 --> 42:11.920
The poison came from Bai Sheng, too.

42:12.000 --> 42:12.880
He told me that

42:12.960 --> 42:14.240
if I could obtain

42:14.320 --> 42:17.400
the Yang family's list
of merchants in Chang'an,

42:17.480 --> 42:19.800
he would support me
in becoming the patriarch.

42:20.320 --> 42:23.400
He also said that if anything went wrong,

42:23.480 --> 42:25.720
I should seek out Zhao Xiuyuan for help!

42:27.960 --> 42:29.880
Did you conspire with Bai Sheng?

42:32.280 --> 42:33.520
He helped you a lot.

42:33.600 --> 42:35.560
What does he want from the Yang family?

42:36.160 --> 42:39.320
He said that once I became
the patriarch of the Yang family,

42:39.400 --> 42:42.000
he would take something from us.

42:42.080 --> 42:44.880
But he never told me what that thing was.

42:45.720 --> 42:47.400
He demanded
a pattern from the Zhao family.

42:49.240 --> 42:50.120
That's right.
